{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02828","headline":"酬张少府柬之 · 卢照邻","name":"酬张少府柬之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔余与夫子，相遇汉川阴。\n珠浦龙犹卧，檀溪马正沈。\n价重瑶山曲，词惊丹凤林。\n十年暌赏慰，万里隔招寻。\n毫翰风期阻，荆衡云路深。\n鹏飞俱望昔，蠖屈共悲今。\n谁谓青衣道，还叹白头吟。\n地接神仙磵，江连云雨岑。\n飞泉如散玉，落日似悬金。\n重以瑶华赠，空怀舞咏心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}